WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.940
Sunday lunch. Piotr visits his grandmother.

2
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.270
Chodź, kochanie, zjesz zupkę?

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.680
Dziękuję, babciu, tylko troszeczkę.

4
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:17.270
Nothing here is small. The endings carry affection.

5
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.440
A potem herbatka i ciasteczko.

6
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.890
Babciu, ja mam trzydzieści lat!

7
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.400
Napijesz się kawki?

8
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.840
A diminutive can describe size, but more often it sets the tone.

9
00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:38.030
It makes an offer friendlier and a request softer.

10
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.700
In formal writing it is out of place.

11
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.180
Ask someone to wait just a moment.

12
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.080
Poczekaj chwileczkę.

13
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.640
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

14
00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.840
Poczekaj chwileczkę.

15
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.720
Offer a friend a nice cup of coffee.

16
00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.980
Napijesz się kawki?

17
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:12.540
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.100
Napijesz się kawki?

19
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.740
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
